Package: nautilus-open-in-terminal
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nautilus, libglib2.0-bin, gnome-terminal | x-terminal-emulator
Description: Open in Terminal entry for the Nautilus context menu
 Adds "Open in Terminal" to the main right-click menu in Nautilus, for
 folders and for the background of the current folder. Any installed
 terminal can be chosen through GSettings, and terminals installed
 later are picked up automatically.
